Goal:
  (and (NOT-rcnot l0_l4_i3) (NOT-rcnot l0_l4_i42) (NOT-rcnot l0_l4_i46) (NOT-rcnot l0_l4_i7) (NOT-rcnot l1_l4_i1) (NOT-rcnot l1_l4_i40) (NOT-rcnot l1_l4_i44) (NOT-rcnot l1_l4_i5) (NOT-rcnot l2_l5_i13) (NOT-rcnot l2_l5_i17) (NOT-rcnot l2_l5_i36) (NOT-rcnot l2_l5_i50) (NOT-rcnot l3_l5_i28) (NOT-rcnot l3_l5_i30) (NOT-rcnot l3_l6_i23) (NOT-rcnot l3_l6_i27) (NOT-rcnot l4_l5_i11) (NOT-rcnot l4_l5_i15) (NOT-rcnot l4_l5_i34) (NOT-rcnot l4_l5_i38) (NOT-rcnot l5_l6_i21) (NOT-rcnot l5_l6_i25))
Metric:
Pred prop:
  (= object object): in_pre in_pre_neg
  (NOT-initialized pqubit): in_init in_pre in_eff
  (NOT-occupied_pqubit pqubit): in_init in_pre in_eff
  (NOT-rcnot gateid): in_pre in_goal in_eff
  (connected pqubit pqubit): in_init in_pre
  (mapped lqubit pqubit): in_pre in_eff
  (rcnot gateid): in_init in_pre in_eff
Func prop:
Global prop:
